---
import Button from '../../ui/Button.astro';
---

<section class="section_home-v2-process">
        <div class="section-gap">
          <div class="container-main">
            <div class="home-v2-process-wrapper">
              <div class="section-header is-center">
                <div class="section-header-title-block is-center">
                  <div class="section-eyebrow">
                    <div class="section-eyebrow-icon w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M10 0C10.75 6.25 13.75 9.25 20 10C13.75 10.75 10.75 13.75 10 20C9.25 13.75 6.25 10.75 0 10C6.25 9.25 9.25 6.25 10 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <div class="section-eyebrow-label">How We Work</div>
                  </div>
                  <h2 class="heading-style-2 section-header-heading">A Clear Process for <span class="heading-accent">Meaningful<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 270 18" height="100%" width="100%" class="heading-accent-line is-blue is-pos-process heading-accent-line is-blue">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" d="M4 9C70 5 160 4 266 7"></path>
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" d="M44 15C120 11 200 10 246 12"></path>
                      </svg></span> Progress</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="section-header-summary-block is-center">
                  <p class="text-size-regular">A typical engagement runs 8–16 weeks. Every phase ends with a decision, not just a document.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="home-v2-process-deck">
                <div class="home-v2-process-list">
                  <div class="home-v2-process-card">
                    <div class="home-v2-process-card-header">
                      <div class="home-v2-process-step">Step 01</div>
                      <div class="home-v2-process-step">Weeks 1–2</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="home-v2-process-card-main">
                      <div class="home-v2-process-figure"><img src="/images/home-v2-process-meeting.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="/images/home-v2-process-meeting-p-500.webp 500w, /images/home-v2-process-meeting-p-800.webp 800w, /images/home-v2-process-meeting-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/home-v2-process-meeting.webp 1200w" alt="Leadership team discussing findings around a meeting table" class="home-v2-process-image" /></div>
                      <div class="home-v2-process-article">
                        <h3 class="heading-style-3">Discover</h3>
                        <div class="home-v2-process-body">
                          <div class="home-v2-process-text">
                            <p class="text-size-regular home-v2-process-desc">Gain a comprehensive understanding of the business by analyzing its core operations, identifying current challenges it faces, and exploring potential opportunities for growth and improvement.</p>
                            <div class="home-process-chips">
                              <div class="home-v2-process-chip">Stakeholder Interviews</div>
                              <div class="home-v2-process-chip">Diagnostic</div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="home-v2-process-quote">
                            <div class="home-v2-process-quote-label">Arcline Working Principle</div>
                            <p class="home-v2-process-quote-text">“We start with the business, not the framework.”</p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <Button href="/about" variant="dark">Learn More</Button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="home-v2-process-card">
                    <div class="home-v2-process-card-header">
                      <div class="home-v2-process-step">Step 02</div>
                      <div class="home-v2-process-step">Weeks 3–5</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="home-v2-process-card-main">
                      <div class="home-v2-process-figure"><img src="/images/home-process-team.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1098px) 100vw, 1098px" srcset="/images/home-process-team-p-500.webp 500w, /images/home-process-team-p-800.webp 800w, /images/home-process-team-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/home-process-team.webp 1098w" alt="Consultants reviewing analysis together on a laptop" class="home-v2-process-image" /></div>
                      <div class="home-v2-process-article">
                        <h3 class="heading-style-3">Analyze</h3>
                        <div class="home-v2-process-body">
                          <div class="home-v2-process-text">
                            <p class="text-size-regular home-v2-process-desc">Turn findings into insight. We model the numbers, map the customer journey and pressure-test every assumption so each option is grounded in evidence.</p>
                            <div class="home-process-chips">
                              <div class="home-v2-process-chip">Market Sizing</div>
                              <div class="home-v2-process-chip">Data Modeling</div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="home-v2-process-quote">
                            <div class="home-v2-process-quote-label">Arcline Working Principle</div>
                            <p class="home-v2-process-quote-text">“Every insight has to survive the numbers.”</p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <Button href="/about" variant="dark">Learn More</Button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="home-v2-process-card">
                    <div class="home-v2-process-card-header">
                      <div class="home-v2-process-step">Step 03</div>
                      <div class="home-v2-process-step">Weeks 6–9</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="home-v2-process-card-main">
                      <div class="home-v2-process-figure"><img src="/images/home-v2-process-meeting.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="/images/home-v2-process-meeting-p-500.webp 500w, /images/home-v2-process-meeting-p-800.webp 800w, /images/home-v2-process-meeting-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/home-v2-process-meeting.webp 1200w" alt="Leadership team agreeing priorities in a strategy workshop" class="home-v2-process-image" /></div>
                      <div class="home-v2-process-article">
                        <h3 class="heading-style-3">Strategize</h3>
                        <div class="home-v2-process-body">
                          <div class="home-v2-process-text">
                            <p class="text-size-regular home-v2-process-desc">Shape a clear plan with your leadership team: prioritized initiatives, a realistic roadmap and the business case needed to secure buy-in.</p>
                            <div class="home-process-chips">
                              <div class="home-v2-process-chip">Strategic Roadmap</div>
                              <div class="home-v2-process-chip">Business Case</div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="home-v2-process-quote">
                            <div class="home-v2-process-quote-label">Arcline Working Principle</div>
                            <p class="home-v2-process-quote-text">“A strategy is only as good as its first ninety days.”</p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <Button href="/about" variant="dark">Learn More</Button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="home-v2-process-card">
                    <div class="home-v2-process-card-header">
                      <div class="home-v2-process-step">Step 04</div>
                      <div class="home-v2-process-step">Weeks 10–16</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="home-v2-process-card-main">
                      <div class="home-v2-process-figure"><img src="/images/home-process-team.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1098px) 100vw, 1098px" srcset="/images/home-process-team-p-500.webp 500w, /images/home-process-team-p-800.webp 800w, /images/home-process-team-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/home-process-team.webp 1098w" alt="Arcline consultants working alongside a client team" class="home-v2-process-image" /></div>
                      <div class="home-v2-process-article">
                        <h3 class="heading-style-3">Execute</h3>
                        <div class="home-v2-process-body">
                          <div class="home-v2-process-text">
                            <p class="text-size-regular home-v2-process-desc">Move from plan to results. We work alongside your teams, set up the operating rhythm and track the KPIs that prove the strategy is working.</p>
                            <div class="home-process-chips">
                              <div class="home-v2-process-chip">Implementation Support</div>
                              <div class="home-v2-process-chip">KPI Tracking</div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="home-v2-process-quote">
                            <div class="home-v2-process-quote-label">Arcline Working Principle</div>
                            <p class="home-v2-process-quote-text">“We measure success by what changes, not what we deliver.”</p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <Button href="/about" variant="dark">Learn More</Button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
